graph TB
    subgraph TGIS["Text Generation Inference Server (TGIS)"]
        direction TB

        subgraph Launcher["text-generation-launcher (Rust)"]
            LauncherCLI[Launcher CLI<br/>Process Orchestrator]
        end

        subgraph Router["text-generation-router (Rust)"]
            gRPCServer["gRPC Server<br/>GenerationService<br/>8033/TCP"]
            HTTPServer["HTTP Server<br/>/health, /metrics<br/>3000/TCP"]
            Validator[Request Validator<br/>+ Tokenizer Pool]
            Batcher[Continuous Dynamic<br/>Batcher + Queue]
            gRPCServer --> Validator
            HTTPServer --> Validator
            Validator --> Batcher
        end

        subgraph Shards["text-generation-server (Python)"]
            Shard0["Shard 0<br/>gRPC over UDS<br/>GPU 0"]
            Shard1["Shard 1<br/>gRPC over UDS<br/>GPU 1"]
            ShardN["Shard N<br/>gRPC over UDS<br/>GPU N"]
        end

        subgraph Kernels["custom_kernels"]
            CUDAKernels[Custom CUDA Kernels<br/>Optimized Attention]
        end

        LauncherCLI -->|spawns| gRPCServer
        LauncherCLI -->|spawns| HTTPServer
        LauncherCLI -->|spawns| Shard0
        LauncherCLI -->|spawns| Shard1
        LauncherCLI -->|spawns| ShardN
        Batcher -->|gRPC over UDS| Shard0
        Shard0 -->|NCCL AllReduce| Shard1
        Shard1 -->|NCCL AllReduce| ShardN
        Shard0 --> CUDAKernels
        Shard1 --> CUDAKernels
        ShardN --> CUDAKernels
    end

    Client[KServe / ModelMesh<br/>Client] -->|gRPC 8033/TCP<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS| gRPCServer
    Kubelet[Kubernetes Kubelet] -->|HTTP 3000/TCP| HTTPServer

    ModelStorage[(Model Weight Storage<br/>PVC /shared_model_storage)] -->|Volume Mount<br/>Read-Only| Shard0
    ModelStorage -->|Volume Mount<br/>Read-Only| Shard1
    ModelStorage -->|Volume Mount<br/>Read-Only| ShardN

    Prometheus[Prometheus] -->|HTTP scrape<br/>3000/TCP /metrics| HTTPServer
    OTel[OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector] -.->|gRPC OTLP<br/>Optional| Router

    style LauncherCLI fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style gRPCServer fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style HTTPServer fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Validator fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Batcher fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Shard0 fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Shard1 fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ShardN fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style CUDAKernels fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Client fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style Kubelet fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style ModelStorage fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style OTel fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
